(mirrors `zetaFE_Gamma_upper_S0`, via `R00GammaLower.norm_Gamma_le_realGamma`). -/
theorem RowFE_Gamma_upper_of {s : ℂ} {v G : ℝ} (hre : s.re = v)
    (hcap : Real.Gamma v ≤ G) (hv : 0 < v) : ‖Complex.Gamma s‖ ≤ G := by
